      "unit": "Ω",
      "explain": "Y = [1.5 −1; −1 1.5] S，Δ_Y = 1.5² − 1² = 1.25 S²；z_11 = y_22/Δ_Y = 1.5/1.25 = 1.2 Ω。验算：2–2' 开路时 z_11 = R_a ∥ (R_c + R_b) = 2 ∥ 3 = 1.2 Ω。"
    },
    {
      "id": "z12",
      "ask": "z_12 = ?",
