      "answer": 1.5,
      "unit": "",
      "explain": "A = −y_22/y_21 = −1.5/(−1) = 1.5。也可用 Z 参数：A = z_11/z_21 = 1.2/0.8 = 1.5。"
    },
    {
      "id": "C",
